ZERO-TRUST ADAPTIVE ACCESS-CONTROL ENGINE — PROPRIETARY LICENCE

Copyright (c) 2026 Ioannis Kalaitzidis. All rights reserved.

This repository contains the complete source code of an academic project (an
MSc assignment for the University of Piraeus): a Zero-Trust adaptive
access-control engine that combines a static rule-based policy baseline with a
hybrid machine-learning risk scorer (Isolation Forest and Gradient Boosting) and
deterministic Zero-Trust overrides, together with the synthetic data generator,
the evaluation, fairness and drift-analysis code, the generated datasets and
figures, and the accompanying documentation.

Publishing this repository does not place any of it in the public domain and
does not grant any licence beyond what is stated below.


