────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ACADEMIC INTEGRITY AND RESPONSIBLE USE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This project was produced as an educational exercise. It is shared for study,
review and demonstration purposes only.

It must not be submitted, in whole or in part, as anyone else's academic work.
Whoever uses this repository is solely responsible for complying with the
academic-integrity rules of their own institution. The author accepts no
responsibility for any consequences of plagiarism or misuse.

The access-control logic here is a laboratory prototype trained on synthetic
data. It is not hardened, audited or intended for production use, and must not
be relied upon to protect any real system or real data without independent
review.


────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CONFIGURATION, CREDENTIALS AND DATA
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

No real API keys, database credentials or other secrets are contained in this
repository. Every user identifier, device identifier, resource name and value
that appears in the dataset is fictional and was produced synthetically by the
project's own generator (01_generate_dataset.py) from a fixed random seed.

The datasets included in this repository contain no personal data and no
information about any real person, employee or system. Any resemblance to real
identifiers is coincidental.


